      "description": "<b>原子订单池</b><br/>销售, 调拨, 退货多种来源<br/><i>GWT/CBM, 时间窗, 温层, 服务等级</i>",
      "domain": "input-constraints",
      "domainClass": "data",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "rules-resource-library",
      "description": "<b>规则与资源库</b><br/>约束条件、策略与资源的管理中心",
      "domain": "input-constraints",
      "domainClass": "data",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "capacity-resource-pool",
      "description": "<b>运力资源池</b><br/>自有/合同/临时车辆, 司机, 线路<br/><i>可用状态、成本模型</i>",
      "domain": "input-constraints",
      "domainClass": "data",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "hard-constraints",
      "description": "<b>硬约束</b><br/>载重, 容积, 法规, 道路限行<br/><i>不可违反的物理与法规限制</i>",
      "domain": "input-constraints",
      "domainClass": "data",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "soft-constraints",
      "description": "<b>软约束</b><br/>成本, 时效, 客户满意度, 负载均衡<br/><i>用于多目标优化的业务偏好</i>",
      "domain": "input-constraints",
      "domainClass": "data",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "data-quality-assessment",
