      "domainClass": "ch",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-review",
      "description": "<b>人工审核与调整</b><br/>合并/拆分/换车/调整路径? <i>保留专家经验</i>",
      "domain": "human-machine-collaboration",
      "domainClass": "ch",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "real-time-monitoring-alerting",
      "description": "<b>实时监控与告警</b><br/>跟踪在途车辆, 异常事件告警<br/><i>ETA动态更新</i>",
      "domain": "human-machine-collaboration",
      "domainClass": "ch",
      "type": "custom",
      "zIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lock-publish-plan",
      "description": "<b>锁定并发布方案</b><br/>确认最终执行计划, 防止变更",
